Subject: [PATCH 06/11] fakePluginDescriptor: remove use

This appears to be part of ag/34951833:

(The latest PluginStructureProvider from IntelliJ codebase became
incompatible with the latest Kotlin codebase.)

Rewrite PluginStructureProvider to adapt to IJ 2025.2

https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-79870
Bug: 418240065
---
 .../standalone/base/projectStructure/PluginStructureProvider.kt  | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/analysis/analysis-api-standalone/analysis-api-standalone-base/src/org/jetbrains/kotlin/analysis/api/standalone/base/projectStructure/PluginStructureProvider.kt b/analysis/analysis-api-standalone/analysis-api-standalone-base/src/org/jetbrains/kotlin/analysis/api/standalone/base/projectStructure/PluginStructureProvider.kt
index c4da60b72e0..7d1b98c29ff 100644
--- a/analysis/analysis-api-standalone/analysis-api-standalone-base/src/org/jetbrains/kotlin/analysis/api/standalone/base/projectStructure/PluginStructureProvider.kt
+++ b/analysis/analysis-api-standalone/analysis-api-standalone-base/src/org/jetbrains/kotlin/analysis/api/standalone/base/projectStructure/PluginStructureProvider.kt
@@ -113,7 +113,6 @@ object PluginStructureProvider {
 
         val listenersMap = ConcurrentHashMap<String, MutableList<ListenerDescriptor>>()
         for (listenerDescriptor in listenerDescriptors) {
-            listenerDescriptor.pluginDescriptor = fakePluginDescriptor
             listenersMap.computeIfAbsent(listenerDescriptor.topicClassName) { SmartList() }.add(listenerDescriptor)
         }
 
